shots/
# tools/video.js output: the scripted promo, and the working frames it is
# tuned against. Reproducible at any commit, needed by no build - unlike
# app/icon/, which is checked in because the Android project reads the
# launcher mipmaps out of the tree. The still store set used to live here
# and is now under shots/, which is ignored above, along with the owner's
# phone takes and the promo joined from them.
store/
# App Store Connect API keys (AuthKey_XXXXXXXXXX.p8). THIS REPO IS PUBLIC, and
# Apple issues a .p8 exactly once: committed, it is a key anyone can use to
# upload builds as this account, and it cannot be un-published. It belongs in
# Codemagic's integration form and a backup, never in this tree.
*.p8
